Create `AiCodeGraph.Core/Architecture/PatternMatcher.cs` with:

```csharp
public static class PatternMatcher
{
    /// <summary>
    /// Match text against glob pattern. Supports * wildcard.
    /// Examples: "*.Domain.*" matches "MyApp.Domain.Entities.User"
    /// </summary>
    public static bool MatchesPattern(string text, string pattern)
    {
        // Handle edge cases
        if (pattern == "*") return true;
        if (!pattern.Contains('*'))
            return text.Equals(pattern, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase);

        // Convert glob to regex: * -> .*, escape other special chars
        var regexPattern = "^" + Regex.Escape(pattern).Replace("\\*", ".*") + "$";
        return Regex.IsMatch(text, regexPattern, RegexOptions.IgnoreCase);
    }

    /// <summary>
    /// Extract namespace/type path from full method name.
    /// "MyApp.Domain.User.Validate()" -> "MyApp.Domain.User"
    /// </summary>
    public static string ExtractNamespacePath(string fullMethodName);
}
```

Key implementation notes:
- Use compiled regex with caching for performance (Regex.IsMatch with pattern reuse)
- Handle patterns with multiple wildcards: "*.Services.*.Handler"
- ExtractNamespacePath removes method name and parameters, keeps namespace.type
- Follow the namespace extraction pattern from CouplingAnalyzer.GetGroup()
- Consider adding pattern validation (no consecutive wildcards, etc.)

